        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Experience the intensity of the Tour de France with the official game!\nTo wear the yellow jersey on the Champs-Elysées, you will need to take risks, attack, sprint and perfect your race tactics. Try out the new, immersive first-person camera and test it in the iconic Liège-Bastogne-Liège race or with the all-new time-trial gameplay.",
